text:
I&#x27;ve not read <i>Friendship is Optimal</i>, nor will I, but I am aware one character smokes for the nootropic effect.<p>Given the tendency for optimisation, self-experimentation, and weird medical interventions, I&#x27;d expect to rank motivations for smoking in this group in the following way:<p><pre><code>  1. &quot;Aaaaaaa, we&#x27;re all going to die! I need something for my nerves!&quot;

  2. They read a MLP fanfic about an AI taking over the world and were inspired.

  3. They think their AI will actually solve all the problems.</code></pre>
